Aquí tienes el **HTML + CSS puro** extraído del componente, con las clases de Tailwind traducidas a CSS plano y el JSX convertido a HTML estándar:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Glowing Footer</title>
  <style>
    /* === Base reset & layout === */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    /* === Glass container (light mode default overridden by dark) === */
    .glass {
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px) saturate(180%);
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(30,0,0,0.1) 60%, #2a0e0e 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    /* === Footer wrapper === */
    .footer-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding-top: 4rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    /* === Glow blobs === */
    .glow-blob-top {
      position: absolute;
      top: -8rem;
      left: 25%;
      width: 18rem;
      height: 18rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.2);
      filter: blur(80px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .glow-blob-bottom {
      position: absolute;
      right: 25%;
      bottom: -6rem;
      width: 20rem;
      height: 20rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.2);
      filter: blur(80px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* === Main glass card === */
    .glass-card {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 72rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .glass-card {
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
    }

    /* === Brand section === */
    .brand-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .brand-section {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }

    .brand-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      display: flex;
      height: 2.25rem;
      width: 2.25rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fb7185, #be123c);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .brand-icon svg {
      height: 1.25rem;
      width: 1.25rem;
      color: white;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fecdd3, #f43f5e);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .brand-desc {
      max-width: 20rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: rgba(245, 245, 245, 0.8);
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .brand-desc {
        text-align: left;
      }
    }

    /* === Social links === */
    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      color: #fb7185;
    }
    .social-links a {
      color: #fb7185;
      transition: color 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .social-links a:hover {
      color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .social-links svg {
      height: 1.25rem;
      width: 1.25rem;
    }

    /* === Navigation columns === */
    .nav-columns {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2.25rem;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .nav-columns {
        width: auto;
        flex-direction: row;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        text-align: left;
      }
    }

    .nav-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .nav-title {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fb7185;
    }

    .nav-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .nav-list a {
      color: rgba(245, 245, 245, 0.7);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-list a:hover {
      color: #f5f5f5;
    }

    /* === Copyright === */
    .copyright {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: rgba(245, 245, 245, 0.7);
    }

    /* === Blob pointer-events layer === */
    .glow-layer {
      pointer-events: none;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 50%;
      z-index: 0;
      height: 100%;
      width: 100%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      user-select: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="footer-wrapper">
    <!-- Glow background blobs -->
    <div class="glow-layer">
      <div class="glow-blob-top"></div>
      <div class="glow-blob-bottom"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Glass card -->
    <div class="glass glass-card">
      <!-- Brand column -->
      <div class="brand-section">
        <a href="#" class="brand-link">
          <span class="brand-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="brand-name">Mvpblocks</span>
        </a>
        <p class="brand-desc">
          Mvpblocks provides a set of reusable components and utilities to help you create beautiful and responsive user interfaces quickly and efficiently.
        </p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter">
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M19.633 7.997c.013.176.013.353.013.53 0 5.387-4.099 11.605-11.604 11.605A11.561 11.561 0 010 18.29c.373.044.734.074 1.12.074a8.189 8.189 0 005.065-1.737 4.102 4.102 0 01-3.834-2.85c.25.04.5.065.765.065.37 0 .734-.049 1.08-.147A4.092 4.092 0 01.8 8.582v-.05a4.119 4.119 0 001.853.522A4.099 4.099 0 01.812 5.847c0-.02 0-.042.002-.062a11.653 11.653 0 008.457 4.287A4.62 4.62 0 0122 5.924a8.215 8.215 0 002.018-.559 4.108 4.108 0 01-1.803 2.268 8.233 8.233 0 002.368-.648 8.897 8.897 0 01-2.062 2.112z" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 .29a12 12 0 00-3.797 23.401c.6.11.82-.26.82-.577v-2.17c-3.338.726-4.042-1.415-4.042-1.415-.546-1.387-1.332-1.756-1.332-1.756-1.09-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.085 1.84 1.237 1.84 1.237 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.306 3.495.999.106-.775.418-1.307.76-1.608-2.665-.301-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.933 0-1.31.469-2.381 1.236-3.222-.123-.303-.535-1.523.117-3.176 0 0 1.007-.322 3.301 1.23a11.502 11.502 0 016.002 0c2.292-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.654 1.653.242 2.873.119 3.176.77.841 1.235 1.912 1.235 3.222 0 4.61-2.805 5.629-5.476 5.925.429.369.813 1.096.813 2.211v3.285c0 .32.217.694.825.576A12 12 0 0012 .29z" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M19 0h-14a5 5 0 00-5 5v14a5 5 0 005 5h14a5 5 0 005-5v-14a5 5 0 00-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-9h3zm-1.5-10.268a1.752 1.752 0 110-3.505 1.752 1.752 0 010 3.505zm15.5 10.268h-3v-4.5c0-1.07-.02-2.450-1.492-2.450-1.495 0-1.725 1.166-1.725 2.372v4.578h-3v-9h2.88v1.23h.04a3.157 3.157 0 012.847-1.568c3.042 0 3.605 2.003 3.605 4.612v4.726z" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation columns -->
      <nav class="nav-columns">
        <div class="nav-group">
          <div class="nav-title">Product</div>
          <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="#">Features</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Pricing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Integrations</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Updates</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-group">
          <div class="nav-title">Company</div>
          <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Careers</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Blog</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-group">
          <div class="nav-title">Resources</div>
          <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="#">Docs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Community</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Support</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Security</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="copyright">
      <span>&copy; 2025 Mvpblocks. All rights reserved.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

**Resumen de la conversión:**

- El JSX del componente `FooterGlow` se pasó a HTML semántico estándar.
- Las clases de Tailwind (`relative`, `z-10`, `overflow-hidden`, `pt-16`, `pb-8`, `flex`, `gap-8`, etc.) se tradujeron a propiedades CSS equivalentes.
- El `<style jsx global>` con las reglas `.glass` y `.glass:where(.dark, .dark *)` se consolidó en una sola clase `.glass` con los valores dark-mode (los que tenían `!important`), que son los que aplican sobre fondo oscuro —el `body` usa `#0a0a0a`.
- Los dos círculos con `bg-rose-600/20 blur-3xl` se convirtieron en `.glow-blob-top` y `.glow-blob-bottom` con `rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.2)` y `filter: blur(80px)`.
- Las columnas de navegación (Product, Company, Resources) mantienen su estructura con un media query en `768px` para cambiar de columna a fila horizontal.
